    "title": "Stolen vehicle recovered in Rosedale, suspect arrested - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Chris Montcalmo ,\n8 hours ago ROSEDALE, MD—A stolen vehicle was located in the Rosedale area on Wednesday afternoon, prompting a heavy police presence.\nAt just after 3 p.m., a stolen vehicle was recovered in the 8200 block of Pulaski Highway (21237).\nPolice tell NottinghamMD.com that at least one suspect has been arrested and taken into custody.\nNo further details are available at this time.",
